# so most old URLs need no redirect at all: /beef/, /chicken/, /pork/,
# /sausage/, /appetizers/, /gluten-free/, /dry-aged-meats/, /freezer-packs/,
# /contact/ and /products/ all resolve to the same page they do today.
#
# Source for the list below: davyjonesqualitymeats.ca/page-sitemap.xml read on
# 26 October 2026, plus /steak/ and /burgers/, which are live but absent from
# that sitemap. 301 is permanent, which is what passes the ranking across.
#
# STILL TO VERIFY BEFORE LAUNCH: cross-check against Google Search Console's
# Pages report. The sitemap only lists what WordPress chose to publish.

